
# User Persona – EMR Instructor Persona

## Primary Persona
EMR Instructor

## Goals
- Monitor student progress
- Identify at-risk students
- Measure competency
- Generate evaluation reports
- Reduce manual reporting

## Actions
- Review dashboard
- Track individual/class performance
- Provide feedback

## Pain Points
- Scattered data
- Manual report preparation
- Difficult report generation
- Difficult to identify trends

## Gains
- Real-time dashboard
- Automated alerts
- Reduced administrative work
- Better visibility
